package app

// R7 SIM-E2E harness: the real chain without Docker and without any mocked response.
//
//	simulated Edge Agent (edge/agent/runner.RunDevice, unchanged)
//	  → per-device TCP proxy (fault injection: drop / refuse, recorded per target)
//	  → real Mosquitto (mTLS, use_identity_as_username, ACL generated by internal/fleet)
//	  → cloud runtime loop (startRuntime, extracted unchanged from Run)
//	  → real PostgreSQL (schema 12) → BFF HTTP + WebSocket (production webauth, OIDC fixture IdP)
//
// Enabled only with R7_SIM_E2E=1, MOSQUITTO_BIN and A1_TEST_DATABASE_URL; the gate refuses SKIP.

